OL,3,GNEWSAO'Neill calls on parties to
OL,4,Apublish reviews into sex offender
OL,5,ADonaldson
OL,6,
OL,7,FFirst Minister Michelle O'Neill has
OL,8,Fcalled on the Democratic Unionist Party
OL,9,F(DUP) and Ulster Unionist Party (UUP)
OL,10,Fto publish their reviews into the
OL,11,Factivities of child sex abuser Jeffrey
OL,12,FDonaldson during his time in their
OL,13,Frespective parties.
OL,15,FThe former DUP leader was given a
OL,16,F15-year jail sentence after he was
OL,17,Fconvicted of 18 child sex offences,
OL,18,Fincluding one count of rape, against
OL,19,Ftwo young girls.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
