OL,5,ADonaldson
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe case was raised by Sinn Fein during
OL,8,Fa matter of the day debate in the
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland Assembly chamber.
OL,11,FThe DUP accused Sinn Fein of using it
OL,12,Fto "score political points".
